xmodel/grok-nfd-review.md:13:### 1. Severity: break — Claim (3), and the “D=0 at all three td-11 entries” half of the status. Mechanism B quotes the 11-A consumer as raw `v_p(P_0 Π)` equality. H8 is `P/μ`. With `μ=M` (the documented default, and td-7 Class A) every quoted window is inhabited, including the empty stack. `S` is an infinite residue class, not `∅`.
