REAL STRUCTURE, not coincidental shape. Three mutually consistent
formalizations all verify exactly on 11 cells (7 repo + 4 new):
(b) R ≐ Res_{y0}[(Jac(P,x^kC)-x^k)/(x^{k+1} A^{k+2})]dy, with CT/
