+The levels and $W_1/W_2$-side assignments were already correct. Only this relabeling makes all band-$\le22$ witness rows vanish and gives the exact 86/86 derivative-row match. `valuation_e2.py` and `d23_ecandidates.json` already use the corrected involution, so their matrices are not discarded; all D25 reconstruction code must now make the true names canonical and treat the old names as an import-only convention.
