+Here $C_{24}$ is a constant $9\times10$ matrix over $K_3=\mathbf Q(\sqrt3)$, has rank four, and has pivot columns 0,1,2,3. All ten diagonal factors are units on every atlas component of the $W_1W_2\ne0$ chart. Consequently one constant rank-five left kernel $L_{24}$ works on all 36 fibers:
