+### 2.6 Output contract and launch gates
+
+Emit from one source of truth:
+
+- a family manifest with all 36 evaluations, radical/chart data, variable order, source hashes, and the corrected deep-label map;
+- the aligned coefficient-vector $\widetilde G_{23}$ and all 36 basis hashes;
