+5. **POSTERIOR (CONJECTURAL):** I assign 6% to all 36 D25 fibers being EMPTY, 22% to a mixed outcome, 72% to all 36 remaining NONEMPTY, and only about 5% conditional probability of finding a corrected `E_CANDIDATE^+ <= 12` on a D25 survivor.
