+
+Equivalently, the D23 reconstruction registry must read
+
+```text
+x74=tg02_54  x75=tg01_54  x76=tg2_54   x77=tg2_49
+x78=tg1_54   x79=tg1_49   x80=tf2_54   x81=tf2_49
+x82=tf1_54   x83=tf1_49
