+ \exists y\ F_{24}=0
+ \iff c_{24}:=L_{24}b_{24}=0.                    \tag{3}
+\]
+
+Equation (3) gives exactly five family compatibility residuals, together with a saved solve map for four frontier variables and a six-dimensional frontier kernel.
