+
+### 2.5 Reconstruction and coefficientwise normal form
+
+Let $z$ be the 22 det23 base variables and $a$ the unresolved lift variables. Replay the D23 manifest over the chart ring $\mathcal R_{36}$:
+
+1. Register the 21 band-free coordinates
+   `x18..x23, x26..x31, x33..x36, x38..x41, x48`, together with `x16,x24,x69`.
+2. Leave `x32,x37` free and solve `x17,x25` using the certified unit $2\times2$ minor.
+3. Backsolve the 22 band pivots in reverse at-use order.
+4. In the Row-22 deep block, choose six kernel coordinates and solve four. Certify the chosen minor as a unit in all 36 components; otherwise split by idempotent masks. Use the corrected x74--x83 map from Section 1.3.
+5. Register `uf30`, the four level-53 tails, and the four possible ordinary level-55 tails. The four level-51 tails belong to the Row-24 frontier and all six level-56 tails are new frontier variables. Prune only after an exact occurrence census.
+
+Substitute this DAG only into the five rows $c_{24}=L_{24}b_{24}$, never into all nine pristine rows. Expand each residual as
+
